OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine for
OL,6,Fmany this evening, although rather
OL,7,Fbreezy in places and feeling quite
OL,8,Fhumid. Cloud and patchy rain will
OL,9,Fspread southeastwards overnight,
OL,10,Fclearing by dawn to leave fresher
OL,11,Fconditions developing from the
OL,12,Fnorthwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FDry and bright, possibly sunny
OL,15,Fin places, but increasingly breezy. A
OL,16,Fband of rain, occasionally heavy, will
OL,17,Fpush east late afternoon, followed by
OL,18,Fa few blustery showers in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
